<title>HONG KONG: HK's housing official to meet property developers.</title>
<headline>HK's housing official to meet property developers.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong's Secretary for Housing Dominic Wong is scheduled to meet property developers on Wednesday, a spokesman for him said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>But Nelson Ng, speaking for Wong, did not reveal the reasons for the meeting.</p>
<p>Local television said the meeting was aimed to find ways to further cool property speculation in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>Speculative activities have been blamed for the rocketing property prices in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
